# --- Twilio — NOT connected yet ---
# TWILIO_PHONE_NUMBER and TWILIO_WHATSAPP_NUMBER below are EXAMPLE /
# placeholder numbers — replace with the real Twilio sender numbers.
# (The older name TWILIO_FROM_NUMBER in README / api/reminders comments
# refers to the same SMS sender; canonical name going forward is
# TWILIO_PHONE_NUMBER. No code reads either name yet.)
TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID=
TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN=
# PLACEHOLDER example numbers — replace with the real Twilio sender numbers:
# TWILIO_PHONE_NUMBER example: +17725550100
# TWILIO_WHATSAPP_NUMBER example: +14155238886 (Twilio WhatsApp sandbox number)
TWILIO_PHONE_NUMBER=
TWILIO_WHATSAPP_NUMBER=

# --- Resend — NOT connected yet ---
# Sender updates@niptei.com is UNVERIFIED — label: needs verified Resend
# domain. Do not send from it until the domain is verified in Resend.
# Login codes (POST /api/auth/login + /api/auth/verify-code, migration
# 0020) are emailed from RESEND_FROM_EMAIL — without it, and without
# RESEND_API_KEY, login stops honestly at step 1 with
# "email_not_configured" (501).
RESEND_API_KEY=
RESEND_FROM_EMAIL=
